      "blocks": {
        "5cf7b958-3a4f-4b0f-bd16-262cd7d85191": {
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Zimms Organics founder, David Zimmerman almost died from internal bleeding, losing 8 pints (70% of blood in his body) of blood due to an ulcer. Shortly after, he was diagnosed with Crohn's disease. Doctors said he would be on medication for the rest of his life, but that wasn't part of his plan. Now he's been off medication for over 6 years with zero flare ups or hospital visits. Learn more about how olive oil helped David heal.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          },
          "type": "text"
        },
        "9d6efa6e-3ca4-495b-8068-60b9d9dfc8d7": {
          "settings": {
