            "text": "<p>HEAL+ contains 100% organic Koroneiki olives, the varietal that helped me get off medication from Crohn's disease. HEAL+ is also our highest polyphenol EVOO yet at <strong>660 mg / kg.</strong></p><p>HEAL+ is super bright, peppery, spicy and packs a serious kick. The high polyphenols provide more antioxidants and health benefits, which is why HEAL+ is best consumed by itself in a shot daily.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          },
          "type": "text"
        }
      },
